\f0\fs24 \cf0 CHRIST DEKERMENDJIAN\
\
This program allows users to encrypt and decrypt messages, with 5 distinct modes.\
1) Vigenere only\
2) Vigenere + column permutations\
3) Vigenere + row permutations\
4) Vigenere + column + row permutations\
5) Vigenere + row + column permutations\
\
The user must enter either 1 2 or 3 to start. 3 exits the program and 1 is for encrypting and 2 is for decrypting. If the user enters a number other than the apporpriate value, the program outputs an error message and exits.\
